WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Heavily holding the freedom

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Choosing the invisible path

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
We wander into the light

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:24.150
Welcome, welcome!

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:26.140
Welcome!

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.050
Come one, come all!

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.260
The new play from the
Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe,

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:37.500
"The Mysterious Tale of the
Ghost-Sealing Moontear Assassin"!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.990
Tonight is the second night!
It's the second half of the show!

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:46.270
Please bring everyone and come see us!

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.170
I'll be waiting for you!

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.280
Welcome, welcome!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:03.280
"THE MYSTERIOUS TALE OF THE
GHOST-SEALING MOONTEAR ASSASSIN"
THE SECOND NIGHT
SOTETSU IBARAGI

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.220
So we were right.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.660
ROLE..
"THE ETERNAL ASSASSIN"
YOJIRO AKIZUKI

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:12.060
So Akizuki is assigned to play
the Eternal Assassin...

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.290
Nakaiya is played by Nakaiya himself.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.890
The Eternal Assassin
is played by the man himself.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:20.200
And whoever is here plays his or her own role.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:25.280
That sounds like something the master
would come up with...

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.000
But I wonder if he would do it.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.240
You're right...

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:19.990
Knight, Rook, Queen, Bishop.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.700
You'll be addressed by your code names.

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:28.510
Neither the British Empire nor the British Navy

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:34.470
have anything to do with your decisions,
activities or whether you live or die.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:38.210
This is an unofficial operation.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.130
Very soon, very very soon...

00:04:55.130 --> 00:05:04.470
I, Jubei Nakaiya, the best merchant around,
will start working!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:22.050
Mr. Ibaragi, I know what you want to say to me.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:24.460
You're wondering why I still haven't
ordered them to set sail

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:27.860
despite the fact that I've already
secured the war funds.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.970
To tell you the truth, I'm still debating.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:34.800
Of course I can't tell that to the others.

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:39.640
Or, you may be thinking that the war
in the north is a lost cause.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.470
I wouldn't say that.

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:49.120
But as the person responsible for the
two thousand lives on this ship, the reality is...

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:13.170
War is the greatest business of all, and
setting it up is a merchant's greatest pleasure.

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:17.340
I'll wait for it as long as it takes!

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:25.940
What? You'll join the play for us?

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:29.620
But that doesn't mean
I'm interested in the play itself.

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:31.460
I'm aware of that.

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:35.220
What you want is the Head...

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.720
And it's the master right now.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:45.430
So, to tell you the truth, I don't know
what the master is thinking.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:52.510
But in the end, our revenge
and the fact that you're here...

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.170
It is exactly as Sotetsu Ibaragi wrote.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:59.180
You knew it, yet still you...

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:09.150
What I've feared the most...

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:12.560
Akizuki-sama, don't tell me
you're going to kill him...

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.500
If it's necessary.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.400
Shinagawa Daiba

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:48.700
"The Mysterious Tale of the
Ghost-Sealing Moontear Assassin!"

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.700
The second night.

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:53.600
The show will start now!

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:58.240
The revenge drama that started in Yokohama.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:03.370
How will it end here in Shinagawa?

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:08.520
I want every one of you to enjoy the show
from the very beginning to the very end!

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:13.250
Thank you very much!

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:45.880
I see... that's where you've been hiding it.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:48.230
Impressive.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.060
Now will you hand it over to me?

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:58.460
It belongs to me to begin with.
I'll transport it to the north in your stead.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.900
You'll transport it there and then what?

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:05.070
Well, who knows...

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:11.610
If you don't know its true purpose,
it's pointless for you to have it.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:17.710
If you ask me, we don't need two playwrights.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.220
That's all.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.950
Now, hurry.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:27.170
It's just begun.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:28.330
What?

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.970
The climax of my play has just begun.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.070
The man behind the hidden scandal!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.040
The true objective of our revenge!

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:48.450
The true Akki Rasetsu!

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:50.720
Punish him!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:19.920
Now, let us watch the Head of the Conqueror
scorch the land, drive the people insane,

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:24.180
and bring disaster and chaos from Hell!

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:29.690
I won't let you do that!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:30.900
Kakunojo!
Miss Kaku!

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:31.760
Kakunojo!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:32.960
We won't let you!

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.430
Neither we nor...

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.330
...the Eternal Assassin!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.030
Akizuki?

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.370
That's nonsense!

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:59.050
Forget the climax! If you die here, you won't
be able to see the play you're so proud of!

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:02.650
I don't have to see it.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:06.830
Because this is the final location for my play.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.830
We don't need to hear your nonsense!
Give us the Head!

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.250
The Eternal Assassin...

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.720
The descendant of the Hermit Jofuku!

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:35.850
The one destined to seal
the Head of the Conqueror!

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.360
Now we'll take the Head!

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:42.900
And seal its evil spirits!

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.930
Ridiculous! How ridiculous!

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:51.440
The hatred and disasters in the world,
the chaos and calamity...

00:12:51.580 --> 00:13:01.580
I, Jubei Nakaiya, with the Head
of the Conqueror, shall rule them all!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.280
I won't let you get away!

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:15.890
What?!

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:16.900
What?

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:30.970
What is this?

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:34.740
Now!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.250
Now!

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:14.020
Miss Kaku!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:23.560
I see, I see...

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.940
So this was supposed to happen?

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:31.840
It's coming back to me at last.

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:34.830
Get off.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:44.890
Finally you reveal your true self:
Parkes'... no, the British Empire's lapdog!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.020
I told you to get off.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.250
Prepare yourself! Jubei Nakaiya!

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.580
We'll punish you, Akki Rasetsu!

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.830
Damn it! It's them again!

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.400
Nakaiya!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:43.980
Jubei's Nakaiya's best merchandise!
No one is going to get it until I find a buyer!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.620
Nakaiya!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.550
Leader!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.920
Watch out!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.410
Go!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.760
Get Nakaiya!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.590
Leader!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:25.550
If it's to fall into the hands of someone
other than the British Empire,

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:27.180
then let it be destroyed!

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.520
How dare you!

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:31.910
So-san!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:36.520
Nakaiya!

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:55.940
Ebisu!

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:59.110
Let me go! I said, let me go!

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.610
The Head!

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:03.910
Finally!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.190
Finally... with my own hands!

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.420
Ebisu...

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.400
Ebisu!

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:26.540
Jubei Nakaiya never dies!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:32.950
I won't die until I see Hell, and true fear,
brought to this world!

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.350
I shall seal it!

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.370
Ebisu!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:02.810
No!

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:13.580
That's... From that time...

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.000
Don't tell me that's Awanokami's...

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:27.930
Set sail, Enomoto!

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.870
Hey, Enomoto!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:39.820
I won't fight a losing battle!

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.440
Never!

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:43.710
Never!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.850
All hands to their stations now!

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.550
All ships, set sail, full speed ahead!

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:18.260
All ships set engines to maximum power!

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:20.450
Course: 0, to the north!

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:23.890
All hands to their stations!

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:25.260
All ships, set sail!

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:26.560
Full speed ahead!

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:28.030
All ships set engines to maximum power!

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.430
Course: 0, to the north!

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:30.630
E-Enomoto!

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:31.930
Set sail!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.970
Set sail!

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:43.950
Don't tell me that thing has gotten to Kamajiro...

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:04.390
Don't you rush to die, Kamajiro...

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:46.110
It is the 19th day of the 8th month, Keio 4:

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:49.940
The fleet of the former Shogun,
commanded by Takeaki Enomoto

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:52.810
sets sail off the coast of Shinagawa.

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:57.280
They head to the north where the situation
has grown extremely tense.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>THE HEAD OF</i>
<i>THE CONQUEROR</i>
<i>WITH A SOUL</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:47.600
EPISODE 14
TO THE NORTH

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:36.990
I have nothing more to say.

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:38.560
Please take care, everyone.

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:40.560
Leader, where are you going?

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:41.290
I am...

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:41.890
Leader!

00:23:41.890 --> 00:23:48.100
Stop asking lame questions, because you
already know whom she wants to follow.

00:23:47.600 --> 00:24:02.580
TO THE NORTH

00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:51.670
No, don't go, don't go!

00:23:51.670 --> 00:23:52.940
I don't want you to go, either!

00:23:52.940 --> 00:23:56.940
Please just leave me alone. Don't follow me.

00:23:56.940 --> 00:24:01.750
But you're going to follow
Samurai-san, aren't you?
